{
  "_comment": "10-step smoke of the P2T baseline on the raw Qwen3-14B-Base weights, with no SFT adapter attached. Every training parameter below is the parent project's protocol (corrected_rl_launcher.common_config), so the only thing that differs from a formal run is the rollout count and the calibration size.",
  "run_name": "smoke10",
  "model_name": "models/Qwen3-14B-Base",
